000010* IF x = SPACES / ZEROS on items longer than 32 bytes (cobc
000020* compares them against libcob's constant buffers).
000030 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000040 PROGRAM-ID. SPACECMP.
000050 DATA DIVISION.
000060 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000070 01 X              PIC X(40).
000080 01 Z              PIC X(50).
000090 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000100 MAIN-PARA.
000110     MOVE SPACES TO X
000120     IF X = SPACES DISPLAY "BLANK" END-IF
000130     MOVE "A" TO X(40:1)
000140     IF X NOT = SPACES DISPLAY "NOT BLANK" END-IF
000150     MOVE ALL "0" TO Z
000160     IF Z = ZEROS DISPLAY "ZEROS" END-IF
000170     MOVE "1" TO Z(1:1)
000180     IF Z NOT = ZEROS DISPLAY "NOT ZEROS" END-IF
000190     STOP RUN.
